<title>UK: Ashbourne Plc surges on bid hopes.</title>
<headline>Ashbourne Plc surges on bid hopes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ashbourne Plc surged by almost 20 percent to a record peak after the nursing home operator said it was approached with a bid proposal.</p>
<p>The shares were up 27-1/2p to 166-1/2p at 0834 GMT.  </p>
<p>In a statement issued early on Monday, Ashbourne said it would make a further announcement as soon as possible.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
